OL,3,GNEWSARoad closure costs demanded after
OL,4,Afactory fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council says it is demanding money
OL,7,Ffrom building owners following a fire,
OL,8,Fafter not getting payment towards costs
OL,9,Fincurred from a road closure.
OL,11,FUpper Villiers Street in Wolverhampton
OL,12,Fhas remained shut since a blaze at a
OL,13,Fbuilding in January "due to concerns
OL,14,Fabout the structural stability of the
OL,15,Fsite", the council said.
OL,17,FMore than 100 firefighters were at the
OL,18,FGrade II listed former Moorfields Works
OL,19,Fin that road and Sunbeam Street in
OL,20,FJanuary, an ex-factory which once
OL,21,Fcontained the Sunbeam Motor Car
OL,22,FCompany.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
